{"id":56089,"date":"2026-08-01T06:28:48","date_gmt":"2026-08-01T05:28:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-corrida-ano-novo-2\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:33:57","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:33:57","slug":"grande-corrida-ano-novo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-corrida-ano-novo\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Corrida Ano Novo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Corrida Ano Novo 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Grande Corrida de Ano Novo 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no primeiro domingo do ano, <strong>3 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio<\/strong> (Terreiro do Pa\u00e7o), em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizada pela consagrada <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 a forma perfeita de inaugurar o novo ano desportivo com energia renovada e boa disposi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta no Terreiro do Pa\u00e7o, o evento abre \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> com a <strong>Kids Race (400m)<\/strong> para os mais novos, seguindo-se a <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> e a <strong>Mini-Corrida \/ Caminhada 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h05<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado inigual\u00e1vel serpenteia pelas ruas e pra\u00e7as mais ilustres da capital \u2014 Rua da Prata, Pra\u00e7a da Figueira, Martim Moniz, Rossio, Restauradores, Rua do Carmo, Chiado \/ Rua Garrett e Av. Ribeira das Naus \u2014, oferecendo camisola t\u00e9cnica de alta qualidade, medalha comemorativa e abastecimentos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapsh